{"id":"581ccc73275b24688a000f22","slug":"wangechi-mutu-try-dismantling-the-little-empire-inside-you","title":"Try Dismantling the Little Empire Inside You","artists":["Wangechi Mutu"],"date":"2007","medium":"Ink, Mylar, pigment and photo collage, in 2 parts","dimensions":null,"image":"zVJsFVdQPqixbE7i-ADeRA","c":["#785734","#b5936a","#fafaf9"],"said":[{"k":"artist","q":"Kenya is rapidly developing its industry and manufacturing, and its cultural identity as a new country. We had a humongous history pre-British, and when we were colonized and violently reshuffled, we had to decide who we were again. We couldn't rest on the stories and the cultures of our great-grandparents.","by":"Wangechi Mutu","via":"Sotheby's: Contemporary Art Day Auction, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"2007","q":"2007","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"owned","who":"Sikkema Jenkins & Co.","q":"Sikkema Jenkins & Co., New York","ll":[40.7127,-74.006],"w":"New York, US","p":"new-york-us","pr":"city","o":1,"s":[1],"x":[0]},{"k":"owned","y":"2007","who":"the present owner","n":"acquired from the above","q":"Acquired from the above by the present owner in 2007","o":2,"s":[1]},{"k":"exhibited","y":"2007-03","e":"2007-07","t":"Global Feminisms","v":"Brooklyn Museum","q":"Brooklyn Museum,* Global Feminisms*, March - July 2007","ll":[40.7127,-74.006],"w":"New York, US","p":"new-york-us","pr":"city","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"written","who":"Sotheby's","n":"catalogue note (\"From the Catalogue\")","q":"Courtesy of Sotheby's","o":1,"s":[1]},{"k":"offered","y":"2016-11-04","e":"2016-11-18","t":"Sotheby’s: Contemporary Art Day Auction (November 2016)","n":"at auction","o":2,"s":[0],"x":[1]},{"k":"listed","y":"2016-11-04","who":"Sotheby's: Contemporary Art Day Auction","n":"listed by the auction house","o":3,"s":[0]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/wangechi-mutu-try-dismantling-the-little-empire-inside-you"},{"name":"Sotheby's: Contemporary Art Day Auction, on Artsy","url":"https://www.art